hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Abu 'Amr ash-Shaybani said"
"2","'Abdullah ibn 'Umar said"
"3","Bahz ibn Hakim's grandfather said"
"4","""I don't know of a deed closer to Allah"
"5","Abu Hurayra said"
"6","""A man came to the Prophet of Allah"
"7","Ibn 'Abbas said"
"8","associating others with Allah"
"9","Hisham ibn 'Urwa related this ayat from his father"
"10","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"11","Sa'id ibn Abi Burda said"
"12","Marwan used to make Abu Hurayra his agent and he used to be located in\nDhu'l-Hulayfa. His mother was in one house and he was in another. When he\nwanted to go out"
"13","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr said"
"14","Abu Hazim reported that Abu Murra"
"15","Abu Bakra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"16","Warrad"
"17","'Allah curses anyone who\nsacrifices an animal to something other than Allah. Allah curses anyone who\nsteals a milestone. Allah curses anyone who curses his parents. Allah curses\nanyone who gives shelter to an innovator.'"""""""""
"18","'Do not associate anything with\nAllah"
"19","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr said"
"20","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr said"
"21","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"22","Mu'adh said"
"23","'Lord"
"24","""Four ayats were revealed about me. The first\nwas when my mother swore she would neither eat nor drink until I left Muhammad"
"25","Asma' bint Abi Bakr said"
"26","Ibn 'Umar said"
"27","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr said that the Prophet"
"28","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr said"
"29","Abu Bakra reported that the Prophet"
"30","'Imran ibn Husayn said"
"31","Ibn 'Umar said"
"32","the\nsupplication of someone who is oppressed"
"33","Abu Hurayra reported that he heard the Messenger of Allah"
"34","Abu Hurayra said"
"35","Supplication for them"
"36","Abu Hurayra said"
"37","Ibn Sirin said"
"38","sadaqa which continues"
"39","Ibn 'Abbas reported that a man said"
"40","'Abdullah ibn Dinar reported that Ibn 'Umar passed by a bedouin during\na journey. The bedouin's father had been a friend of 'Umar's. The bedouin\nsaid"
"41","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"42","Sa'd ibn 'Ubada az-Zurqi reported that his father said"
"43","Abu Bakr ibn Hazm reported that one of the Companions of the Prophet"
"44","Abu Hurayra saw two men and said to one of them"
"45","Shahr ibn Hawshab said"
"46","'Abdullah ibn Dinar said reported that Ibn 'Umar said"
